    "intro_html":  "Trini curry chicken starts with green seasoning and blooming curry powder in hot oil, and ends with chicken and potatoes swimming in gravy you will want to drink. Each bowl delivers a big \u003cstrong\u003e58 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.07\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Island flavor made at home.",
